SUMMARY:Rocky Fork Double - Abt 7 Miles\, 1300 Ft EG\, Maybe More
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nRocky Fork State Park in in TN and
  about 40 minutes from the carpool area up I26 from Asheville. We will sta
 rt out with the White House Cliffs out-and-back hike at just 2 miles but 1
 000 ft of elevation gain on the up section but a spectacular view at the t
 op. After a short break at the cars\, we will head up Flint Creek and prob
 ably just do an out-and-back. The trail crosses the creek several times on
  foot bridges and the fall colors should be spectacular. For those of you 
 that did this hike with me last spring\, I don't plan to do the loop with 
 the deep water crossing at the end. It might be a little chilly for that o
 n Monday but I could be convinced otherwise.\n\nBring some snacks for afte
 r the hike before we head back to Asheville. I hear someone is turning 67.
 \n\n**CARPOOL**\nLet's meet at the USDA Forest Service Supervisor's Office
  by just off the UNCA/Broadway exit on I26 at 8:30. If you plan to meet at
  the trailhead\, please let me know. We should be ready to start hiking by
  9:15.\n\n**WEATHER**\nThe weather currently might be okay for Monday but 
 I'll watch the weather and post a cancellation message by 7:00 AM if there
  is a chance of severe weather or lightning during this time period..\n\n*
 *QUESTIONS?**\nYou can message me through MeetUp until 8:00 AM the day of.
  Cell reception may be sketchy\, but you can try to text or call me up to 
 the start of the hike: (508) 965-2333.\n\n**LEGALESE**\nThis Asheville Hik
 ing Group event involves hiking and\, possibly\, transportation to and fro
 m the meetup site. Participants are responsible for their own safety and a
 ffirm that they have the appropriate skills\, physical conditioning\, equi
 pment\, and supplies. Hiking may involve risks to oneself and property. Ne
 ither your hike organizer nor Asheville Hiking Group can assure your safet
 y nor eliminate all risks. Participants assume full responsibility for any
  injuries\, damages\, or losses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/316998379
 /
